# NOTE: The generated plugin payload (plugins/prd-ce/{skills,agents,hooks,scripts,
# templates}/) is intentionally TRACKED, not ignored. A GitHub plugin marketplace
# serves files from the cloned repo, so the payload must be committed for consumers
# to install it. `.claude/` remains the authoring source (strategy B); CI guards the
# two against drift via scripts/check-plugin-sync.sh. Do not re-add ignore rules here.
